# =====================================================
#  AURELIA GRAND RESORT — API TESTLERİ
#  Önce A1 ve A3'ü çalıştır (token'lar alınır)
#
#  Seed verisi:
#  Kullanıcılar: 1 Kardelen (admin), 2 Ayşe, 3 Elif (müşteri)
#  Odalar: 1-150 Standard, 151-240 Deluxe, 241-285 Family, 286-300 King
#  Rezervasyonlar: 1 Ayşe (601, +20 gün, ödenmiş)
#                  2 Ayşe (102, şu an otelde)
#                  3 Elif (101, +40 gün, ödeme bekliyor)
# =====================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080


# ============ A) GİRİŞ ============

### A1) Admin girişi (Kardelen) → 200, role: "admin"
# @name admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "kardelen@aurelia.com",
  "password": "Aurelia2026!"
}

### A2) Yeni müşteri kaydı → 201 (ikinci kez 409, normal)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Deniz Kaya",
  "email": "deniz@example.com",
  "password": "Musteri2026!"
}

### A3) Müşteri girişi (Elif) → 200, role: "customer"
# @name customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "elif@example.com",
  "password": "Musteri2026!"
}


# ============ P) HERKESE AÇIK ============

### P1) Oda tipleri → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/room-types

### P2) Müsait oda arama (30 gün sonra, 2 gece, 4 kişi) → sadece Family Suite'ler
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/available?checkIn={{$localDatetime 'YYYY-MM-DD' 30 d}}&checkOut={{$localDatetime 'YYYY-MM-DD' 32 d}}&guests=4

### P3) Tüm odalar — token yok → 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms

### P4) Tüm odalar — müşteri → 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{customer.response.body.token}}


# ============ C) TAM İADE AKIŞI (girişe 60 gün) ============

### C1) Rezervasyon (oda 103) → 201 (aynı gün tekrar 409)
# @name fullRes
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{customer.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 3,
  "checkInDate": "{{$localDatetime 'YYYY-MM-DD' 60 d}}",
  "checkOutDate": "{{$localDatetime 'YYYY-MM-DD' 62 d}}",
  "guestCount": 2
}

### C2) Ödeme → 201 (6.000 ₺)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/{{fullRes.response.body.id}}/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{customer.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "card"
}

### C3) İptal önizleme → refundPercent: 100, refundAmount: 6000
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/{{fullRes.response.body.id}}/cancellation-preview
Authorization: Bearer {{customer.response.body.token}}

### C4) İptal → 200, cancelled
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/{{fullRes.response.body.id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{customer.response.body.token}}

### C5) Ödeme → status: refunded, refundAmount: 6000
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/{{fullRes.response.body.id}}/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{customer.response.body.token}}


# ============ H) YARIM İADE AKIŞI (girişe 3 gün) ============

### H1) Rezervasyon (oda 104) → 201 (aynı gün tekrar 409)
# @name halfRes
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{customer.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 4,
  "checkInDate": "{{$localDatetime 'YYYY-MM-DD' 3 d}}",
  "checkOutDate": "{{$localDatetime 'YYYY-MM-DD' 5 d}}",
  "guestCount": 2
}

### H2) Ödeme → 201 (6.000 ₺)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/{{halfRes.response.body.id}}/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{customer.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "card"
}

### H3) İptal önizleme → refundPercent: 50, refundAmount: 3000
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/{{halfRes.response.body.id}}/cancellation-preview
Authorization: Bearer {{customer.response.body.token}}

### H4) İptal → 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/{{halfRes.response.body.id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{customer.response.body.token}}

### H5) Ödeme → refundAmount: 3000
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/{{halfRes.response.body.id}}/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{customer.response.body.token}}


# ============ D) ADMIN ============

### D1) Dashboard → activeRooms: 300, occupiedRooms: 1, inHouseCount: 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}

### D2) Ödeme bekleyen (Elif #3) iptal önizleme — admin → 100, iade 0 (ödeme yok)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/3/cancellation-preview
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}

### D3) Otelde olan (Ayşe #2) iptal önizleme → cancellable: false
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/2/cancellation-preview
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}

### D4) Başkasının rezervasyonu (Ayşe #1) — Elif → 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/1/cancellation-preview
Authorization: Bearer {{customer.response.body.token}}